{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0989aa9dc5a833d898b","chatId":"3ea2c1a6b63044a6a81db4a6040e0ef8","sessionId":null,"userId":98176,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1248,"promptTokens":1510,"completionTokens":71,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575017131584593,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0989aa9dc5a833d898a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482328258,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0989aa9dc5a833d898a","chatId":"3ea2c1a6b63044a6a81db4a6040e0ef8","sessionId":null,"userId":98176,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n雅各布是个非常有条理的人，喜欢在日历上计划自己的活动。原本他和女朋友斯蒂芬妮计划今天下午约会，所以他围绕这件事安排了整天的日程。中午，斯蒂芬妮给他发消息说，因为她那天没有其他安排，她的朋友邀请她去参加一个很棒的生日派对，她将会参加。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，雅各布最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望\nB) 惊喜\nC) 嫉妒\nD) 尴尬\nE) 感激\nF) 好奇\n\n## 问题 2\n雅各布为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的女朋友忘记了他们的日程\nB) 他的女朋友打算和别人而不是他在一起待着\nC) 他的女朋友给他们的约会策划了一个惊喜\nD) 他的女朋友将要参加一个有趣的派对","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575017131584593,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0989aa9dc5a833d898b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482328255,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f47f77740c7d405c9a1458b694299184"}